---
// Figure for the stocks-basics series, Post 8 (macro and industry). Numbers are from the sources cited in the post.
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
const W = 900;
const H = 296;
---
<figure class="sbp8-sbp08loss2022">
  <div class="sc">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="2022 price falls: Novaland 84 percent, Phat Dat 81, Vietnam Germany Steel Pipe 72, TPBank 49, VN-Index 32.78.">
      <text x="20" y="28" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>The 2022 fall was not even: sectors that borrow most fell furthest</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Năm 2022 không giảm đều: ngành vay nhiều giảm sâu nhất</tspan></text>
<text x="20" y="75" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>NVL (Novaland, property)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>NVL (Novaland, bất động sản)</tspan></text>
      <rect x="250" y="56" width="352.8" height="28" rx="4" class="barr" />
      <text x="612.8" y="75" class="h">-84%</text>
      <text x="20" y="117" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>PDR (Phat Dat, property)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>PDR (Phát Đạt, bất động sản)</tspan></text>
      <rect x="250" y="98" width="340.2" height="28" rx="4" class="barr" />
      <text x="600.2" y="117" class="h">-81%</text>
      <text x="20" y="159" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>VGS (steel pipe)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>VGS (ống thép)</tspan></text>
      <rect x="250" y="140" width="302.4" height="28" rx="4" class="barr" />
      <text x="562.4000000000001" y="159" class="h">-72%</text>
      <text x="20" y="201" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>TPB (TPBank, bank)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>TPB (TPBank, ngân hàng)</tspan></text>
      <rect x="250" y="182" width="205.8" height="28" rx="4" class="barr" />
      <text x="465.8" y="201" class="h">-49%</text>
      <text x="20" y="243" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>VN-Index</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>VN-Index</tspan></text>
      <rect x="250" y="224" width="137.7" height="28" rx="4" class="bard" />
      <text x="397.67600000000004" y="243" class="h">-32.78%</text>
      <text x="20" y="274" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>80% of stocks on HOSE and HNX closed 2022 lower; 404 fell more than the index</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>80% cổ phiếu trên HOSE và HNX đóng cửa 2022 thấp hơn; 404 mã giảm sâu hơn chỉ số</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Falls over calendar 2022. Sources: VnExpress International ("80% of stocks fall in 2022", citing RongViet Securities) and The Investor for the VN-Index (-32.78%).</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Mức giảm trong năm 2022. Nguồn: VnExpress International ("80% of stocks fall in 2022", trích RongViet Securities) và The Investor cho VN-Index (-32,78%).</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .sbp8-sbp08loss2022 { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .sc { overflow-x: auto; }
  .sbp8-sbp08loss2022 svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .sbp8-sbp08loss2022 text { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .sbp8-sbp08loss2022 .t { font-size: 15.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp8-sbp08loss2022 .h { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp8-sbp08loss2022 .b { font-size: 12.8px; }
  .sbp8-sbp08loss2022 .m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12px; }
  .sbp8-sbp08loss2022 .n { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp8-sbp08loss2022 .red { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .sbp8-sbp08loss2022 .grn { fill: var(--act-2); font-weight: 700; }
  .sbp8-sbp08loss2022 .gld { fill: var(--gold); font-weight: 700; }
  .sbp8-sbp08loss2022 .card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .sbp8-sbp08loss2022 .cardr { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .sbp8-sbp08loss2022 .cardg { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .sbp8-sbp08loss2022 .cardk { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--act-2); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .sbp8-sbp08loss2022 .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.8; fill: none; }
  .sbp8-sbp08loss2022 .lnr { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2.4; fill: none; }
  .sbp8-sbp08loss2022 .lng { stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 2.4; fill: none; }
  .sbp8-sbp08loss2022 .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; fill: none; stroke-dasharray: 3 4; }
  .sbp8-sbp08loss2022 .ah { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .sbp8-sbp08loss2022 .barr { fill: var(--red); }
  .sbp8-sbp08loss2022 .barg { fill: var(--act-2); }
  .sbp8-sbp08loss2022 .barm { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .sbp8-sbp08loss2022 .bard { fill: var(--gold); }
  .sbp8-sbp08loss2022 figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
